# Host builds are macOS binaries and per-machine state; the image builds its own.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.nuxt
**/.output
**/.data
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright

# Run journals and logs belong to the machine that produced them.
**/.movy
logs
*.log

# Secrets never enter an image layer. Compose passes them at run time.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
docker/*.env

.git
.claude
